00:06:35.235 --> 00:06:37.058
So that was a little bit of
a hard transition for me.

00:06:37.058 --> 00:06:43.394
But what I would say is the African
community in Stanford is extremely strong,

00:06:43.394 --> 00:06:48.482
so that served as a base of support,
of encouragement, while I

00:06:48.482 --> 00:06:53.793
went through the transition and navigated
&gt;&gt; Anything for you?

00:06:53.793 --> 00:06:58.700
