00:07:17.578 --> 00:07:18.766
[INAUDIBLE]
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]

00:07:18.766 --> 00:07:19.634
&gt;&gt; So that's pretty tough.

00:07:19.634 --> 00:07:21.430
&gt;&gt; Yeah, that sounds tough.

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:26.726
So you guys have now spent over
one year each at Stanford, and

00:07:26.726 --> 00:07:29.450
you've been here for a few months already.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:33.949
I would love for you guys to just
discuss how being at Stanford has

00:07:33.949 --> 00:07:37.447
changed the way you plan
to either work in Africa or

00:07:37.447 --> 00:07:40.798
how you plan to impact
the continent of Africa?

00:07:40.798 --> 00:07:44.415
&gt;&gt; I can go first, I think for
me the biggest shift, and

00:07:44.415 --> 00:07:49.937
I don't think it was necessarily a shift,
I think it's just a reinforcement.

00:07:49.937 --> 00:07:51.602
So coming into Stanford,

00:07:51.602 --> 00:07:56.441
the two things that were important
to me were technology and Africa.

00:07:56.441 --> 00:08:00.605
But I didn't really know how this two
merge and whether that means I'll start up

00:08:00.605 --> 00:08:04.102
my own thing, that whether that
meant working Big Tech in Africa.

00:08:05.411 --> 00:08:09.342
But being in Stanford given we're
in Silicon Valley, I will just.

00:08:09.342 --> 00:08:13.960
Exposed to so much technology,
innovative technology, not so

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:18.010
innovative technology,
all sorts of technology.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:23.700
I feel like I have a much better sense of
what technology in Africa means to me.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:27.570
And those two parts of myself which
I thought were almost despaired

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:28.860
are coming together.

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:35.939
&gt;&gt; I think somewhat similar to what
Nlanda said, coming into Stanford I have

00:08:35.939 --> 00:08:40.665
a FinTech background and all the things
I was thinking about were in FinTech,

00:08:40.665 --> 00:08:46.100
all the ways to impact Africa for me was
how can FinTech change X and Y industry?

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:48.403
